<title>UK: KEXIM prices $500 mln five-year global bond, +45bp.</title>
<headline>KEXIM prices $500 mln five-year global bond, +45bp.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond has been priced, joint lead managers Morgan Stanley and Salomon Brothers said.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EXPORT-IMPORT BANK OF KOREA</p>
<p> AMT	  $500 MLN  COUPON     6.50	MATURITY    10.FEB.02</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  99.266    PAY DATE    10.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.30	REOFFER    99.266    SPREAD	+ 45 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	A1	  LISTING    LUX/HK    PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 1	   SALE LIMITS **</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    NEW YORK  HOME CTRY  KOREA     TAX PROVS   =</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.05	SELL CONC  0.25	PRAECIPUUM  NONE</p>
<p> NOTES    **US/GB/JP/HK/KR/SI</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
